# ouroboros#181 (round 152): a 2-element literal arg list to a 1-parameter
# callee whose parameter is a Value* class. The VM re-collects the list
# WHOLE (EigenScript#733): g's `b` is [a, b] and `len of b` is 2. Refused
# until round 152 ("the call-site pack is not emitted yet"); the call site
# now builds the list the VM re-collects and passes it as the one argument.
# (Was refuse/arity1_recollect.)
define g(b) as:
    return len of b
define h(a, b) as:
    return g of [a, b]
buf is zeros of 4
print of (h of [buf, 2])
